# config/pr-learning-trust - GitHub logins whose PR review comments feed
# automatic review learning (bin/fm-pr-activity.sh). Copy this into a local,
# gitignored config/pr-learning-trust and replace the placeholders.
# One login per line; blank lines and text after # are ignored, and logins
# compare without case. An absent or empty file trusts nobody.
#
# Comments from any other login still wake firstmate but never run learning,
# and the PR author's own comments never wake. A review bot that posts as a
# person's account is trusted through that account's login.
your-login
teammate-login
review-bot[bot]
